sh the stack into the first empty column.\n\n\n"}
{"step_index":18,"source":"USER_EXPLICIT","type":"USER_INPUT","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-16T07:12:08Z","content":"<USER_REQUEST>\nhãy bổ sung thêm: thay vì băng chuyền, hãy để 1 slot trống ở dưới, nếu không có màu trùng với quân cuối của cột được click, thì hãy đẩy quân đó xuống slot trống, nhưng chỉ được đẩy 1 quân, nếu click vào quân bài chỗ slot đó, nếu có cột có quân cùng màu thì đẩy vào đó, nếu không có nhưng có cột trống thì đẩy vào cột trống, còn không có chỗ nào để đi thì click vô hiệu\n</USER_REQUEST>\n<ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\nThe current local time is: 2026-11-16T14:12:08+07:00.\n</ADDITIONAL_METADATA>"}
{"step_index":19,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-16T07:12:08Z","input_tokens":53722,"cache_read_tokens":0,"output_tokens":9477,"thinking":"I'm thinking through how to approach this.\n\n\nThe user's rule focuses on moving a sequence of same-colored cards from one column to another or a holding slot below. Three priority scenarios exist: moving the sequence to a column with a matching final card, moving it to an empty column, or moving only the topmost card to the holding slot if the other conditions are not met. The core logic involves these prioritized actions depending on the card sequence and available spaces.\n\n\nThe rules for handling card movements to the holding slot are clarified, prioritizing matching colors in columns, then empty columns, and finally disabling clicks if no suitable target exists. Clear column logic remains unchanged, requiring a column to contain only cards of a single color. There's a realization about the strategic role of a 1-card holding slot in game mechanics.\n\n\nNow the 1-card holding slot enables new moves, solving a previously unsolvable scenario. The game now permits moving one card at a time to the holding slot, even from a column with different colors, offering a strategic advantage. It can temporarily hold a card to reveal others underneath or manage the placement of multiple cards of the same color.\n\n\nThis level design challenges the player to utilize the single-card holding slot from the outset. The initial board state features three columns, each containing three cards of mixed colors, preventing direct column-to-column moves and forcing strategic use of the holding slot to free up cards. This setup tests the slot's utility in breaking a deadlock, a critical element for demonstrating its strategic depth. The level's specific color arrangement ensures the player encounters this critical move immediately.\n\n\nThe optimal move starts by transferring the single 'Xanh' card from column 2 to the empty holding slot. This reveals a 'Đỏ' card below. Then, the 'Đỏ' from column 3 can merge with the 'Đỏ' from column 2. Following this, merging 'Vàng' from column 1 into the now-empty column 3 clears it. Finally, there's a need to consider the order of handling columns 1 and 2 to reveal more matching pairs.\n\n\nThe next move involves moving the two 'Đỏ' cards from Column 2 to the empty Column 3, revealing a single 'Xanh' card in Column 2. Then, the single 'Xanh' from Column 1 goes into Column 2, now containing two 'Xanh' cards. The single 'Xanh' card in the holding slot is then placed into Column 2 to make a complete set of 'Xanh'.\n\n\nAnalyzing an alternative move sequence. Initiating with Cột 1 (`Vàng`) leads to clearing Cột 2, then Cột 1, and subsequently winning by clearing Cột 3. The other start would not lead to clearing the puzzle.\n\n\n\nFocusing on the puzzle's mechanics, a key strategy emerged: clearing Column 3 by grouping three matching cards, then matching Column 1 to Column 2 which also uses Column 3. Examining the potential use of slot emptying rules where a column ends with multiple cards of same color, a new level design is proposed to force the player to use that rule. The level focuses on isolating card combinations to trigger a situation where only one card is allowed to be moved to the holding slot even when multiple of the same color are available. This clarifies optimal moves and slot usage.\n\n\nThe core insight focuses on the critical role of the single-card holding slot (Slot Trống) in the game's mechanics. Specifically, moving cards to this slot is only strategically beneficial when the column's bottom group consists of a single card, as it reveals the cards beneath. Pushing multiple cards of the same color to this slot does not reveal any new information while simultaneously preventing the slot from being reused. This becomes a crucial concept that can guide the player.\n\n\nThe strategic insight emphasizes only moving a single card to the holding slot to reveal cards underneath. This \"single card only\" rule is crucial; multi-card moves block slot reuse and don't reveal information. The design of subsequent levels will leverage this constraint. Màn 2 with three columns (`Đỏ, Vàng, Xanh`, `Xanh, Xanh, Vàng`, `Vàng, Đỏ, Đỏ`) will be tested. Initial column bottoms are `Xanh`, `Vàng`, and `Đỏ, Đỏ`. A move to the holding slot is required as no columns match.\n\n\nThe initial move with a single 'Đỏ' to the holding slot is crucial. Column 3 remains blocked, leading to an immediate impasse demonstrating the \"single card\" rule. Attempting to move any of the lower cards results in a failure because the slot is blocked, reinforcing that rule.\n\nConsidering the alternative of moving 'Vàng' from Column 2, Column 2 becomes clear by first creating a single 'Xanh' group and then clearing the column. However, this creates a new configuration with 'Đỏ, Vàng' in Column 1, 'Vàng' in the holding slot, and 'Vàng, Đỏ, Đỏ' remaining in Column 3, still not resolved. It exposes an alternative sequence of steps.\n\n\nFocusing on solving Màn 2, the optimal sequence appears to involve Column 2's 'Vàng', leading to column clearing. This move reveals matching colors that lead to merging columns, ultimately clearing the board. Other initial moves result in dead-ends, confirming a critical path strategy where column clearing is key, and incorrect move sequences result in blockages.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Interactive prototype updated with a 1-Card Holding Slot (replacing the conveyor belt), implementing 1-card-only push to slot, clickable slot with color-over-empty priority, and pure-column clearing.","UserFacing":true},"Content":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <script src=\"https://www.gstatic.com/antigravity/web/dev/tailwindcss.min.js\"></script>\n  <style>\n    .card-item {\n      transition: transform 0.18s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1), opacity 0.18s ease;\n    }\n    .col-clickable:hover .bottom-group {\n      transform: translateY(3px) scale(1.02);\n    }\n    .slot-card:hover {\n      transform: translateY(-2px) scale(1.03);\n    }\n    @keyframes shake {\n      0%, 100% { transform: translateX(0); }\n      25% { transform: translateX(-5px); }\n      75% { transform: translateX(5px); }\n    }\n    .shake-anim {\n      animation: shake 0.25s ease-in-out;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-transparent text-[var(--foreground)] antialiased p-2 select-none\">\n  <div class=\"bg-[var(--card)] text-[var(--foreground)] border border-[var(--border)] rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm\">\n    <!-- Header & Controls -->\n    <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 mb-3\">\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n          <h2 class=\"text-[var(--foreground)] font-semibold text-base\">Card Sort 1-Chạm (Có Ô Chứa Tạm 1 Quân)</h2>\n          <span id=\"level-badge\" class=\"text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-[var(--secondary)] text-[var(--secondary-foreground)] font-medium\">Màn 1</span>\n        </div>\n        <p id=\"status-text\" class=\"text-[var(--muted-foreground)] text-xs mt-0.5\">\n          Click cột: Ưu tiên Cột cùng màu ➔ Cột trống ➔ Đẩy 1 quân xuống Slot trống bên dưới.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5\">\n        <button id=\"btn-undo\" onclick=\"undoMove()\" class=\"text-xs px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg border border-[var(--border)] bg-[var(--background)] hover:opacity-80 disabled:opacity-40 font-medium\">\n          ↩ Undo\n        </button>\n        <button onclick=\"resetLevel()\" class=\"text-xs px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg border border-[var(--border)] bg-[var(--background)] hover:opacity-80 font-medium\">\n          ⟳ Chơi lại\n        </button>\n        <button onclick=\"nextLevel()\" class=\"text-xs px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-[var(--primary)] text-[var(--primary-foreground)] hover:opacity-90 font-medium\">\n          Đổi màn (1/2/3)\n        </button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Columns Area -->\n    <div id=\"columns-container\" class=\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-3 mb-3 min-h-[215px] items-start\">\n      <!-- Rendered via JS -->\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Bottom Holding Slot Area -->\n    <div class=\"rounded-xl border border-[var(--border)] bg-[var(--background)] p-3 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-3\">\n      <div class=\"text-xs text-[var(--muted-foreground)] space-y-0.5\">\n        <div class=\"font-semibold text-[var(--foreground)]\">📥 Slot Trống Tạm (Sức chứa tối đa: 1 quân bài)</div>\n        <div id=\"hint-text\">Khi không có cột trùng màu hay cột trống, click cột sẽ đẩy 1 quân cuối xuống đây.</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div id=\"holding-slot\" onclick=\"onSlotClick()\" class=\"w-48 h-12 rounded-xl border-2 border-dashed border-[var(--border)] flex items-center justify-center cursor-pointer transition-colors hover:border-[var(--primary)] px-2 shrink-0\">\n        <!-- Slot content rendered via JS -->\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <script>\n    const COLORS = {\n      R: { name: 'Đỏ', bg: '#ef4444', border: '#b91c1c', text: '#ffffff', label: 'ĐỎ' },\n      Y: { name: 'Vàng', bg: '#eab308', border: '#a16207', text: '#ffffff', label: 'VÀNG' },\n      B: { name: 'Xanh', bg: '#3b82f6', border: '#1d4ed8', text: '#ffffff', label: 'XANH' },\n      P: { name: 'Tím', bg: '#a855f7', border: '#6b21a8', text: '#ffffff', label: 'TÍM' }\n    };\n\n    const LEVELS = [\n      {\n        name: 'Màn 1 (3 Cột · Phá thế bí bằng Slot)',\n        targetCount: 3,\n        hint: 'Gợi ý: Click Cột 2 (đẩy Xanh xuống Slot) ➔ Cột 3 ➔ Cột 1 ➔ Cột 2 ➔ Cột 1 ➔ Click Slot!',\n        columns: [\n          ['R', 'B', 'Y'],\n          ['B', 'R', 'B'],\n          ['Y', 'Y', 'R']\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        name: 'Màn 2 (3 Cột · Bẫy đẩy nhầm cụm 2 lá)',\n        targetCount: 3,\n        hint: 'Lưu ý: Đừng bấm Cột 3 đầu tiên (vì chỉ 1 lá Đỏ xuống Slot, lá Đỏ thứ 2 vẫn chặn cột)! Hãy bấm Cột 2.',\n        columns: [\n          ['R', 'Y', 'B'],\n          ['B', 'B', 'Y'],\n          ['Y', 'R', 'R']\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        name: 'Màn 3 (4 Cột · 4 Màu)',\n        targetCount: 3,\n        hint: 'Kết hợp Slot tạm, ưu tiên cột cùng màu và dọn cột trống để Clear cả 4 màu.',\n        columns: [\n          ['R', 'P', 'B'],\n          ['Y', 'Y', 'R'],\n          ['P', 'B', 'P'],\n          ['B', 'R', 'Y']\n        ]\n      }\n    ];\n\n    let currentLevelIdx = 0;\n    let columns = [];\n    let holdingSlot = null; // null or colorKey ('R', 'Y', 'B', 'P')\n    let history = [];\n    let isAnimating = false;\n\n    function cloneState() {\n      return {\n        columns: columns.map(c => [...c]),\n        holdingSlot\n      };\n    }\n\n    function initLevel(idx) {\n      currentLevelIdx = idx;\n      const lvl = LEVELS[idx];\n      columns = lvl.columns.map(c => [...c]);\n      holdingSlot = null;\n      history = [];\n      isAnimating = false;\n      document.getElementById('level-badge').textContent = lvl.name;\n      document.getElementById('hint-text').textContent = lvl.hint;\n      const grid = document.getElementById('columns-container');\n      grid.className = `grid ${columns.length === 4 ? 'grid-cols-4' : 'grid-cols-3'} gap-3 mb-3 min-h-[215px] items-start`;\n      setStatus('Click vào cột để di chuyển bài. Nếu không có cột nhận, 1 quân cuối sẽ xuống Slot trống.');\n      render();\n    }\n\n    function setStatus(msg) {\n      document.getElementById('status-text').textContent = msg;\n    }\n\n    function getBottomGroupCount(col) {\n      if (col.length === 0) return 0;\n      const bottomColor = col[col.length - 1];\n      let count = 0;\n      for (let i = col.length - 1; i >= 0; i--) {\n        if (col[i] === bottomColor) count++;\n        else break;\n      }\n      return count;\n    }\n\n    function isPureFullColumn(col) {\n      const target = LEVELS[currentLevelIdx].targetCount;\n      if (col.length !== target) return false;\n      return getBottomGroupCount(col) === target;\n    }\n\n    function triggerShake(el) {\n      if (!el) return;\n      el.classList.remove('shake-anim');\n      void el.offsetWidth;\n      el.classList.add('shake-anim');\n    }\n\n    function render() {\n      const container = document.getElementById('columns-container');\n      container.innerHTML = '';\n      const target = LEVELS[currentLevelIdx].targetCount;\n\n      columns.forEach((col, cIdx) => {\n        const groupCount = getBottomGroupCount(col);\n        const colEl = document.createElement('div');\n        colEl.id = `col-box-${cIdx}`;\n        colEl.className = 'col-clickable flex flex-col items-center p-2.5 rounded-xl border border-[var(--border)] bg-[var(--background)] cursor-pointer relative min-h-[205px] transition-colors hover:border-[var(--primary)]';\n        colEl.onclick = () => onColumnClick(cIdx);\n\n        const header = document.createElement('div');\n        header.className = 'w-full flex justify-between items-center text-xs text-[var(--muted-foreground)] mb-2 font-medium';\n        header.innerHTML = `<span>Cột ${cIdx + 1}</span><span>${col.length} lá</span>`;\n        colEl.appendChild(header);\n\n        if (col.length === 0) {\n          const emptyEl = document.createElement('div');\n          emptyEl.className = 'flex-1 w-full flex items-center justify-center border border-dashed border-[var(--border)] rounded-lg text-xs text-[var(--muted-foreground)] text-center px-2';\n          emptyEl.textContent = 'Cột trống';\n          colEl.appendChild(emptyEl);\n        } else {\n          const stackEl = document.createElement('div');\n          stackEl.className = 'w-full flex flex-col items-center pt-1';\n\n          col.forEach((colorKey, cardIdx) => {\n            const c = COLORS[colorKey];\n            const isBottomGroup = cardIdx >= col.length - groupCount;\n            const card = document.createElement('div');\n            card.className = `card-item w-full h-9 rounded-lg border-2 flex items-center justify-between px-2.5 font-bold text-xs shadow-sm ${isBottomGroup ? 'bottom-group' : 'opacity-90'}`;\n            card.style.backgroundColor = c.bg;\n            card.style.borderColor = c.border;\n            card.style.color = c.text;\n            if (cardIdx > 0) {\n              card.style.marginTop = '-9px';\n            }\n\n            let badgeText = '';\n            if (cardIdx === col.length - 1) {\n              const match = findTargetColumnForColumnClick(colorKey, cIdx);\n              if (match) {\n                badgeText = `Ghép ${groupCount} lá ➔ Cột ${match.targetIdx + 1}`;\n              } else if (!holdingSlot) {\n                badgeText = `Đẩy 1 lá ➔ Slot ▼`;\n              } else {\n                badgeText = `Kẹt (${groupCount} lá)`;\n              }\n            }\n\n            card.innerHTML = `\n              <span>${c.label}</span>\n              ${badgeText ? `<span class=\"px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-black/25 text-xs\">${badgeText}</span>` : ''}\n            `;\n            stackEl.appendChild(card);\n          });\n          colEl.appendChild(stackEl);\n        }\n\n        container.appendChild(colEl);\n      });\n\n      // Render holding slot\n      const slotEl = document.getElementById('holding-slot');\n      slotEl.innerHTML = '';\n      if (!holdingSlot) {\n        slotEl.className = 'w-52 h-11 rounded-xl border-2 border-dashed border-[var(--border)] flex items-center justify-center text-xs text-[var(--muted-foreground)] shrink-0';\n        slotEl.textContent = 'Trống (Chứa tối đa 1 quân)';\n      } else {\n        const c = COLORS[holdingSlot];\n        const target = findTargetColumnForSlot(holdingSlot);\n        slotEl.className = 'w-52 h-11 rounded-xl border-2 border-[var(--border)] p-1 flex items-center justify-center cursor-pointer shrink-0';\n        const card = document.createElement('div');\n        card.className = 'slot-card w-full h-full rounded-lg border-2 flex items-center justify-between px-3 font-bold text-xs shadow-sm transition-transform';\n        card.style.backgroundColor = c.bg;\n        card.style.borderColor = c.border;\n        card.style.color = c.text;\n        card.innerHTML = `\n          <span>${c.label} (1 lá)</span>\n          <span class=\"px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-black/25 text-xs\">${target ? `➔ Cột ${target.targetIdx + 1} ▲` : 'Chờ chỗ trống'}</span>\n        `;\n        slotEl.appendChild(card);\n      }\n\n      document.getElementById('btn-undo').disabled = history.length === 0 || isAnimating;\n    }\n\n    /**\n     * Find target column when clicking column `startColIdx` with bottom color `color`:\n     * Priority 1: Another column whose bottom card matches `color`\n     * Priority 2: An empty column\n     */\n    function findTargetColumnForColumnClick(color, startColIdx) {\n      const n = columns.length;\n      for (let step = 1; step < n; step++) {\n        const idx = (startColIdx + step) % n;\n        const col = columns[idx];\n        if (col.length > 0 && col[col.length - 1] === color) {\n          return { targetIdx: idx, reason: 'color_match' };\n        }\n      }\n      for (let step = 1; step < n; step++) {\n        const idx = (startColIdx + step) % n;\n        if (columns[idx].length === 0) {\n          return { targetIdx: idx, reason: 'empty_col' };\n        }\n      }\n      return null;\n    }\n\n    /**\n     * Find target column when clicking the card inside the Holding Slot:\n     * Priority 1: Any column whose bottom card matches `color`\n     * Priority 2: Any empty column\n     */\n    function findTargetColumnForSlot(color) {\n      for (let idx = 0; idx < columns.length; idx++) {\n        const col = columns[idx];\n        if (col.length > 0 && col[col.length - 1] === color) {\n          return { targetIdx: idx, reason: 'color_match' };\n        }\n      }\n      for (let idx = 0; idx < columns.length; idx++) {\n        if (columns[idx].length === 0) {\n          return { targetIdx: idx, reason: 'empty_col' };\n        }\n      }\n      return null;\n    }\n\n    async function sleep(ms) {\n      return new Promise(r => setTimeout(r, ms));\n    }\n\n    async function checkAndClearPureColumn(colIdx) {\n      const col = columns[colIdx];\n      const target = LEVELS[currentLevelIdx].targetCount;\n      if (isPureFullColumn(col)) {\n        const colorKey = col[0];\n        render();\n        await sleep(260);\n        col.splice(0, col.length);\n        setStatus(`💥 Cột ${colIdx + 1} gom đủ ${target} lá ${COLORS[colorKey].name} thuần 1 màu ➔ CLEAR SẠCH CỘT!`);\n        render();\n      } else if (getBottomGroupCount(col) === target && col.length > target) {\n        const colorKey = col[col.length - 1];\n        setStatus(`📌 Cột ${colIdx + 1} đã có ${target} lá ${COLORS[colorKey].name}, nhưng chưa Clear vì phía trên vẫn còn màu khác!`);\n      }\n\n      const totalRemaining = columns.reduce((acc, c) => acc + c.length, 0) + (holdingSlot ? 1 : 0);\n      if (totalRemaining === 0) {\n        setStatus('🎉 CHIẾN THẮNG! Bạn đã dọn sạch toàn bộ bàn chơi!');\n      }\n    }\n\n    async function onColumnClick(colIdx) {\n      if (isAnimating) return;\n      const col = columns[colIdx];\n      if (col.length === 0) {\n        setStatus(`Cột ${colIdx + 1} đang trống. Hãy click vào cột có bài hoặc quân bài ở Slot dưới!`);\n        return;\n      }\n\n      const count = getBottomGroupCount(col);\n      const color = col[col.length - 1];\n      const match = findTargetColumnForColumnClick(color, colIdx);\n\n      // Case 1 or 2: Move all `count` matching bottom cards to matching-color column or empty column\n      if (match) {\n        history.push(cloneState());\n        isAnimating = true;\n        col.splice(col.length - count, count);\n        for (let i = 0; i < count; i++) {\n          columns[match.targetIdx].push(color);\n        }\n        if (match.reason === 'color_match') {\n          setStatus(`✅ Ghép ${count} lá ${COLORS[color].name} từ Cột ${colIdx + 1} sang Cột ${match.targetIdx + 1} (cùng màu).`);\n        } else {\n          setStatus(`📥 Đưa ${count} lá ${COLORS[color].name} từ Cột ${colIdx + 1} vào Cột trống (Cột ${match.targetIdx + 1}).`);\n        }\n        await checkAndClearPureColumn(match.targetIdx);\n        isAnimating = false;\n        render();\n        return;\n      }\n\n      // Case 3: No matching column and no empty column -> Try pushing ONLY 1 card to Holding Slot\n      if (!holdingSlot) {\n        history.push(cloneState());\n        col.pop(); // Push ONLY 1 card!\n        holdingSlot = color;\n        if (count > 1) {\n          setStatus(`📥 Đã đẩy 1 lá ${COLORS[color].name} từ Cột ${colIdx + 1} xuống Slot trống (chỉ đẩy được 1 lá, còn ${count - 1} lá trên cột).`);\n        } else {\n          setStatus(`📥 Không có cột trùng màu ➔ Đẩy 1 lá ${COLORS[color].name} từ Cột ${colIdx + 1} xuống Slot trống.`);\n        }\n        render();\n        return;\n      }\n\n      // Invalid click: Slot is already occupied and no column can receive this color\n      triggerShake(document.getElementById(`col-box-${colIdx}`));\n      setStatus(`⚠️ Không đi được! Không có cột trùng màu/trống, và Slot tạm bên dưới đã đầy.`);\n    }\n\n    async function onSlotClick() {\n      if (isAnimating) return;\n      if (!holdingSlot) {\n        setStatus('Slot tạm đang trống. Khi click vào cột không có chỗ ghép, 1 lá bài sẽ rơi xuống đây.');\n        return;\n      }\n\n      const color = holdingSlot;\n      const match = findTargetColumnForSlot(color);\n      if (!match) {\n        triggerShake(document.getElementById('holding-slot'));\n        setStatus(`⚠️ Vô hiệu! Hiện chưa có cột nào có màu ${COLORS[color].name} ở cuối và cũng chưa có cột trống.`);\n        return;\n      }\n\n      history.push(cloneState());\n      isAnimating = true;\n      holdingSlot = null;\n      columns[match.targetIdx].push(color);\n\n      if (match.reason === 'color_match') {\n        setStatus(`🔼 Đẩy lá ${COLORS[color].name} từ Slot tạm lên Cột ${match.targetIdx + 1} (cùng màu).`);\n      } else {\n        setStatus(`🔼 Đẩy lá ${COLORS[color].name} từ Slot tạm vào Cột trống (Cột ${match.targetIdx + 1}).`);\n      }\n\n      await checkAndClearPureColumn(match.targetIdx);\n      isAnimating = false;\n      render();\n    }\n\n    function undoMove() {\n      if (history.length === 0 || isAnimating) return;\n      const prev = history.pop();\n      columns = prev.columns;\n      holdingSlot = prev.holdingSlot;\n      setStatus('Đã quay lại 1 bước (Undo).');\n      render();\n    }\n\n    function resetLevel() {\n      if (isAnimating) return;\n      initLevel(currentLevelIdx);\n    }\n\n    function nextLevel() {\n      if (isAnimating) return;\n      initLevel((currentLevelIdx + 1) % LEVELS.length);\n    }\n\n    initLevel(0);\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>\n","Overwrite":true,"Path":"C:\\Users\\Admin\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\0ca39d47-bf1d-4d04-97dc-9c2fe64cb8c8\\conveyor_card_sort_demo.html"}}]}
